I raised this before in PR #693 (https://www.ietf.org/mail-archive/web/tls/=
current/msg21600.html).

I'm not sure it makes sense to rename this to legacy while other parts of t=
he document still refer to it. But I'm definitely in favor of deprecating i=
t.

